{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05743","headline":"送贺监归四明应制 · 李林甫","name":"送贺监归四明应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挂冠知止足，岂独汉疏贤。\n入道求真侣，辞恩访列仙。\n睿文含日月，宸翰动云烟。\n鹤驾吴乡远，遥遥南斗边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李林甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}